  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:350px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-dimgray pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Existence Theft</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/1/1c/Crimson_Denizens.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20190516030652\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Crimson Denizens\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/1/1c/Crimson_Denizens.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20190516030652\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/1/1c/Crimson_Denizens.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20190516030652 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/1/1c/Crimson_Denizens.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20190516030652 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Crimson Denizens\" width=\"270\" height=\"270\" data-image-key=\"Crimson_Denizens.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Crimson Denizens.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Crimson Denizens (Shakugan no Shana)</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Steal existence from others.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The power to <b>steal existence from others. </b>Sub-Power of <a href=\"/wiki/Existence_Manipulation\" title=\"Existence Manipulation\">Existence Manipulation</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FExistence_Theft%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Existence Absorption/Thievery/Stealing</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FExistence_Theft%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can steal existences from another being, which will overwrite the user's own existence with the one that they stole, leaving the target with no life, being, family, friends, powers, skills, etc.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FExistence_Theft%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ancestry_Manipulation\" title=\"Ancestry Manipulation\">Ancestry Theft</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Being_Manipulation\" title=\"Being Manipulation\">Being Theft</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Context_Manipulation\" title=\"Context Manipulation\">Context Theft</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Descendancy_Manipulation\" title=\"Descendancy Manipulation\">Descendancy Theft</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Identity_Theft\" title=\"Identity Theft\">Identity Theft</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Kinship_Manipulation\" title=\"Kinship Manipulation\">Kinship Theft</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Memory_Manipulation\" title=\"Memory Manipulation\">Memory Theft</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Absorption\" title=\"Mind Absorption\">Mind Theft</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Soul_Absorption\" title=\"Soul Absorption\">Soul Theft</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Absorption\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Power Absorption\">Superpower Theft</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Talent_Theft\" title=\"Talent Theft\">Talent Theft</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Usurp_Worth\" title=\"Usurp Worth\">Usurp Worth</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Omni-Power_Replication\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Omni-Power Replication\">Omni-Power Replication</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FExistence_Theft%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Thievery\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Absolute Thievery\">Absolute Thievery</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Attribute_Exchange\" title=\"Attribute Exchange\">Attribute Exchange</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Existence\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Absolute Existence\">Absolute Existence</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Existence_Manipulation\" title=\"Existence Manipulation\">Existence Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Existence_Replication\" title=\"Existence Replication\">Existence Replication</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Existence_Switching\" title=\"Existence Switching\">Existence Switching</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Identity_Manipulation\" title=\"Identity Manipulation\">Identity Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Life_Manipulation\" title=\"Life Manipulation\">Life Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Reality_Warping\" title=\"Reality Warping\">Reality Warping</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Self-Existence_Manipulation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Self-Existence Manipulation\">Self-Existence Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/True-Self_Deception\" title=\"True-Self Deception\">True-Self Deception</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FExistence_Theft%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Those of <a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Immunity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Absorption Immunity\">Absorption Immunity</a>, as well as those of <a href=\"/wiki/Power_Immunity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Power Immunity\">regular</a> to <a href=\"/wiki/Meta_Power_Immunity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Meta Power Immunity\">Meta Power Immunity</a>, can render the power useless against them.</li>\n<li>Subjects of <a href=\"/wiki/Reality_Anchoring\" title=\"Reality Anchoring\">Reality Anchoring</a> can also fend off the user.</li>\n<li>Individuals that possess <a href=\"/wiki/Self_Origin_Manipulation\" title=\"Self Origin Manipulation\">Self Origin Manipulation</a>, or even <a href=\"/wiki/Origin_Manipulation\" title=\"Origin Manipulation\">Origin Manipulation</a>, can counter the user's ability, since they can contradict their own existence into possibly bypassing the effects.</li>\n<li>Users of <a href=\"/wiki/Nigh-Omnipotence\" title=\"Nigh-Omnipotence\">Nigh-Omnipotence</a> might have the capability of undoing the effects, whereas <a href=\"/wiki/Omnipotence\" title=\"Omnipotence\">True Omnipotence</a> can.</li>\n<li>While the user could manage to fight back those of <a href=\"/wiki/Time_Manipulation\" title=\"Time Manipulation\">Time Manipulation</a>, those of <a href=\"/wiki/Meta_Time_Manipulation\" title=\"Meta Time Manipulation\">Meta Time Manipulation</a> can outmatch the user, as well as undoing the damage with little to no issue.</li>\n<li>Can still have the troubles and bad aspects of another person's life.</li>\n<li>May only be temporary.</li>\n<li>May not be able to take away the target's memories.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FExistence_Theft%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-4971\">SCP-4971-▽ - The One Who Knows Silence In The Earth</a> (<i>SCP Foundation</i>)</li>\n<li>All <a href=\"https://shakugan.fandom.com/wiki/Crimson_Denizen\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:shakugan:Crimson Denizen\">Crimson Denizens</a> (<i>Shakugan no Shana</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://shakugan.fandom.com/wiki/Crimson_Lord\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:shakugan:Crimson Lord\">Crimson Lords</a> (<i>Shakugan no Shana</i>)</li>\n<li>Universe Tree (<i>Dragon Ball series</i>)</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260731153704\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.021 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.035 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 126/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 89/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 76/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    8.910      1 Template:Infobox\n100.00%    8.910      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_powerlisting:pcache:idhash:350727-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260731153704 and revision id 2392809. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>",
